flowchart LR
  accTitle: Application delivery to Vertex
  accDescr: A change to application source is tested and scanned in GitHub Actions. Verified images are published to GHCR and their immutable digests are promoted into the private Fleet repository. Rancher Fleet reconciles Kubernetes workloads, which perform readiness checks before serving traffic.
  Source["Application source<br/>change + review"]:::source --> CI["GitHub Actions<br/>build + test + scan"]:::control
  CI --> Image["GHCR<br/>verified image digest"]:::storage
  Image --> Git["Fleet repository<br/>pinned desired state"]:::source
  Git --> Fleet["Rancher Fleet<br/>reconcile"]:::control
  Fleet --> K8s["Kubernetes workload<br/>readiness + service"]:::gateway
  classDef source fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#fdba74,color:#7c2d12,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef control fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#a5b4fc,color:#3730a3,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef storage fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#86b99e,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef gateway fill:#3730a3,stroke:#312e81,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:2px
